   The rule the platform owner specified, in one place:

     Provider  coloured only when the endpoint + key verified.
     Model     coloured only when the model verified AND its parent
               provider verified — a tick on an unverified endpoint
               would claim more than was actually tested.
     Count     verified-model count beside the provider badge:
               grey at 0, green above 0.

   One component so the providers list, the models list and the models
   sub-page header cannot drift apart on what "verified" looks like.
